        <p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_2861e279-6e2e-44ca-a241-24666e7d2370" id="_2861e279-6e2e-44ca-a241-24666e7d2370"></a>Unless otherwise indicated, the copyright in the works contained in this publication is owned by the Government of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region. You may generally copy and distribute these materials in any format or medium provided the following conditions are met -</p>
