</p>
<p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo8;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_55cb7309-0719-30c9-d464-88a87414cc06" id="_55cb7309-0719-30c9-d464-88a87414cc06"></a>the copying is not done for the purpose of creating copies for sale;
